From 7a83055ce51bb7284669de5c0645c052b31611e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: integrate MT6897 modem and SCP lifecycle
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adapt modem startup, reset, exception and power ownership to MT6897
and synchronize CCCI states with the SCP transport.

